{"content":[{"c":["HODIAH, HODIJAH*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. A man of Judah mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.19","r":"1Chr.4.19","rawR":"1Chr.4.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.19","value":"1Chr.4.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 4:19"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2, 3, 4. Three of the men who signed the covenant of Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.10,13,18","r":"Neh.10.10,13,18","rawR":"Neh.10.10,13,18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.10,13,18","value":"Neh.10.10,13,18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:10, 13, 18"},") bear this name; two of them are perhaps among those who interpreted the covenant to the people at Ezra’s public reading of the law (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.7","r":"Neh.8.7","rawR":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.7","value":"Neh.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"8:7"},") and stood upon the stairs of the Levites during the service of covenant renewal (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.9.5","r":"Neh.9.5","rawR":"Neh.9.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.9.5","value":"Neh.9.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"HodiahHodijah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 4:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.19","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.19","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.19"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:10, 13, 18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.10,13,18","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.10,13,18","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.10,13,18"},{"anchorText":"8:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.8.7","rawQueryValue":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefExact":"Neh.8.7"},{"anchorText":"9:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.9.5","rawQueryValue":"Neh.9.5","sourceRefExact":"Neh.9.5"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"b